# Named <dockerfile>.dockerignore, not .dockerignore: the build context is the
# repo root, and Docker only reads .dockerignore from the context root. BuildKit
# looks for this per-Dockerfile form first, which lets the two services in this
# monorepo keep separate exclude lists.
#
# Excludes everything the API image never needs — keeps the context small and
# stops a stale local build tree from leaking into the image.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/.git/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/web/
packages/
docs/
infra/
.github/
*.md
